gin="0:39.041" end="0:39.449">向天空</span></p><p begin="0:39.449" end="0:40.842" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:39.449" end="0:40.842">我在这 就在这</span></p><p begin="0:40.842" end="0:42.163" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:40.842" end="0:41.054">哪</span><span begin="0:41.054" end="0:41.484">也不去</span> <span begin="0:41.484" end="0:42.163">面如刀锋</span></p><p begin="0:42.163" end="0:44.773" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:42.163" end="0:42.733">感谢你们</span><span begin="0:42.733" end="0:43.340">用言语</span><span begin="0:43.481" end="0:44.151">把我推上</span><span begin="0:44.151" end="0:44.413">绞</span><span begin="0:44.413" end="0:44.773">架</span></p><p begin="0:44.960" end="0:45.948" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:44.960" end="0:45.088">我要</span><span begin="0:45.088" end="0:45.278">活</span><span begin="0:45.278" end="0:45.379">得</span><span begin="0:45.379" end="0:45.628">像</span><span begin="0:45.628" end="0:45.768">烈</span><span begin="0:45.768" end="0:45.948">日</span></p><p begin="0:45.948" end="0:47.367" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:45.948" end="0:46.247">把糖</span><span begin="0:46.247" end="0:46.358">衣</span><span begin="0:46.358" end="0:46.578">炮</span><span begin="0:46.578" end="0:46.717">弹</span><span begin="0:46.717" end="0:46.995">烤</span><span begin="0:46.995" end="0:47.367">化</span></p><p begin="0:47.374" end="0:48.650" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:47.374" end="0:48.196">生命只有一</span><span begin="0:48.196" end="0:48.650">次</span></p><p begin="0:48.668" end="0:49.985" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:48.668" end="0:48.888">想</span><span begin="0:48.888" end="0:48.989">得</span><span begin="0:48.989" end="0:49.985">透彻所以勇敢</span></p><p begin="0:49.985" end="0:51.033" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:49.985" end="0:51.033">我跟他们不一样</span></p><p begin="0:51.033" end="0:52.615" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:51.033" end="0:51.334">身</s